, {"type": "skill", "content": "Writing"}, {"type": "skill", "content": "Speaking"}]}, {"type": "post_instructions", "contents": [{"type": "text", "content": "Instructions: Complete the following steps. Fill in the Self Assessment."}]}], "template_override": 1}], "id": 0, "type": "scholar", "stimuli": [{"id": 0, "_data": [], "template_override": 1, "type": "welcome", "contents": [{}]}, {"id": 3, "type": "video", "title": "", "_data": [], "template_override": 1, "contents": [{"type": "video", "value": {"video_src": "engenn5le05ob02re2vid01", "images": [{"text": "", "id": 0, "time": "0", "image": ""}, {"text": "Sally's Suitcase<br /><br />I arrived in Athens late last Monday. From my hotel window, I saw the Parthenon. I was struck by the imposing white structure sitting on the plateau above the city. It was lit up for all to see.", "id": 1, "time": "100", "image": ""}, {"text": "I decided to trek up there the next day. It was a steeper climb than I expected. The Parthenon was much bigger than I imagined. It was also more beautiful. It sat gleaming white in the morning sun.", "id": 2, "time": "13700", "image": ""}, {"text": "Only temple priests ever went inside. In the smaller interior stood a 40 foot ivory and gold statue of Athena.\nIn 1812 Lord Elgin took pieces of the temple back to London. Sadly, the British collection is larger than the one in Athens.", "id": 3, "time": "26700", "image": ""}]}}]}, {"id": 4, "type": "text", "title": "", "_data": [], "template_override": 1, "contents": [{"type": "p", "value": "Sally's Suitcase<br/><br/>\n\nI arrived in Athens late last Monday. From my hotel window, I saw the Parthenon. I was struck by the imposing white structure sitting on the plateau above the city. It was lit up for all to see.<br/><br/>\nI decided to trek up there the next day. It was a steeper climb than I expected. The Parthenon was much bigger than I imagined. It was also more beautiful. It sat gleaming white in the morning sun.<br/><br/>\nOnly temple priests ever went inside. In the smaller interior stood a 40 foot ivory and gold statue of Athena. In 1812 Lord Elgin took pieces of the temple back to London. Sadly, the British collection is larger than the one in Athens."}]}]}], "_data": [{"type": "metadata", "contents": [{"type": "lesson_name", "content": "Sally on the Aegean Sea"}, {"type": "unit_name", "content": "Exploring Ancient Sites"}, {"type": "position", "content": 2}, {"type": "origin", "content": "scholar > Exploring Ancient Sites > The Parthenon"}, {"type": "lesson", "content": 5}, {"type": "level", "content": "A2.2"}]}, {"type": "achievment_test", "contents": [{"type": "test", "content": "false"}]}, {"type": "objectives", "contents": [{"type": "primary", "content": " Accurately use information about people's jobs and places of work in communicative situations."}, {"type": "secondary_1", "content": "Identifies the expressions and vocabulary necessary for the description of places of work and jobs in common written and spoken situations."}, {"type": "secondary_2", "content": " Understands important information and aspects of attitude and intention in spoken situations in English on a range of common communicative topics related to this level. "}, {"type": "secondary_3", "content": " Understands important information and aspects of attitude and intention in spoken situations in English on a range of common communicative topics related to this level. "}, {"type": "secondary_4", "content": " Understands important information and aspects of attitude and intention in spoken situations in English on a range of common communicative topics related to this level. "}, {"type": "secondary_5", "content": " Identifies the expressions and vocabulary necessary for the description of places of work and jobs in common written and spoken situations."}, {"type": "secondary_6", "content": " Understands important information and aspects of attitude and intention in spoken situations in English on a range of common communicative topics related to this level. "}, {"type": "secondary_7", "content": " Understands important information and aspects of attitude and intention in spoken situations in English on a range of common communicative topics related to this level. "}, {"type": "secondary_8", "content": "Identifies the expressions and vocabulary necessary for the description of places of work and jobs in common written and spoken situations. "}]}, {"type": "background_image", "content": "engenn5le05ob02re1img01.jpg"}, {"type": "learning_points", "contents": [{"type": "heading", "content": " Buildings and Structures"}, {"type": "describer", "content": "When you talk about buildings and structures, you can talk about : the interior, the exterior, parts of the structure, size, color and material."}, {"type": "table", "content": "{\"rows\":5,\"columns\":2,\"cells\":[\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class =\\\"strong\\\"> Description </span>\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class =\\\"strong\\\">Explanation</span>\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\" interior / exterior\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\" inside or outside\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\" parts of a structure\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\" floor, ceiling, window, doorway, wall, balcony\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"size\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\" large, small, massive\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\" color and material\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"white marble<br /> red brick<br /> blue glass<br /> deep brown wood\\\"}\"],\"styles\":\"\"}"}, {"type": "example", "content": "The white pillars gleamed in the morning sun."}, {"type": "example", "content": "The building was much bigger than I imagined. "}]}, {"type": "learning_points", "contents": [{"type": "heading", "content": "The Simple Past Tense"}, {"type": "describer", "content": " When you form the Past Simple tense, verbs can be regular or irregular. You  add -ed to regular verbs. Irregular verbs change in a different way for each verb."}, {"type": "table", "content": "{\"rows\":4,\"columns\":2,\"cells\":[\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class =\\\"strong\\\"> Infinitive </span>\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class =\\\"strong\\\"> Simple Past </span>\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"to arrive<br /> to decide<br /> to impress\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"arrived<br /> decided<br /> impressed\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"to leave<br /> to be<br /> to light<br />\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"left<br /> was/were<br /> lit\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\" to stand<br /> to take\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"stood<br /> took\\\"}\"],\"styles\":\"\"}"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Persephone cried.  "}, {"type": "example", "content": "She missed the greener world above.  "}, {"type": "example", "content": "Hades finally relented. "}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "imposing"}, {"type": "definition", "content": "noticeable because of the large size"}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(adjective)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: Those mountains are imposing."}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn5le05ob02aud01"}]}, {"type": "target_word_describer", "contents": [{"type": "text", "content": " These are words you use to talk about the Parthenon. "}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "plateau"}, {"type": "definition", "content": "large, flat land, higher than the area around it "}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(noun)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: The castle is on the plateau above the town."}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn5le05ob02aud02"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "to be lit "}, {"type": "definition", "content": "a light illuminates something "}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(expression)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: At night the Parthenon  was lit up and easy  to see."}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn5le05ob02aud03"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "to imagine "}, {"type": "definition", "content": "to have an image in your mind "}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(verb)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: I tried to imagine a Greek god."}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn5le05ob02aud04"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "gleaming "}, {"type": "definition", "content": "to shine with a soft light "}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(adjective)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: The candle gleamed in the dark room."}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn5le05ob02aud05"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "priest "}, {"type": "definition", "content": "a person who performs religious duties in a temple "}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(verb)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: Only the priests could perform religious ceremonies."}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn5le05ob02aud06"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "interior "}, {"type": "definition", "content": "the inside part of something "}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(noun)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example:The interior of the house is painted in light colors. "}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn5le05ob02aud07"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "collection "}, {"type": "definition", "content": "to put together things that are the same "}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(noun)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: The collection of statues was impressive."}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn5le05ob02aud08"}]}, {"type": "takeaway_extension", "contents": [{"type": "text", "content": "Describe a monument or sight you saw in the past."}, {"type": "text", "content": "Say what it looked like."}, {"type": "text", "content": "Say what you saw, felt, thought about it."}, {"type": "text", "content": "Read your description to a partner."}]}, {"type": "takeaway_assessment", "contents": [{"type": "text", "content": "I describe a monument or sight."}, {"type": "text", "content": "I write 50 to 60 words about what I saw in the past."}, {"type": "text", "content": "I read my sentences aloud."}]}], "type": "sena"}